            "review_id": "REV_15837399_p1_0",
            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Happybread 76",
            "review_text": "HenryLee\nTennessee2 contributions\n0\n2019 Vietnam Food Tour\nSep 2019\nI came by this beautiful restaurant on an insanely hot day. When i set my foot in, i could feel the super cool air from the AC. It was like a whole new world. Everything was absolutely amazing. The restaurant was decorated nicely, i loved how the light was set up. The Food here was very delicious and the price is quite reasonable. I especially loved the JJ bread, a plate of fresh mango and coconut coffee, a nice combo for a sunny afternoon. The staff have already got my eyes immediately since the moment i walked into the place. They are very friendly and they always have a wide smile on their faces which makes me really happy. If you was on a trip to Danang, you definitely should check out this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 18, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
