            "review_title": "Review at Happybread 76",
            "review_text": "Nguyễn Minh Nguyên\nDa Nang, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nHappy Bread 76 - Mì AA\nSep 2019 • Friends\nToday, I visited this bakery. I really like it. The space is so airy and cozy. It is decorated nice and quite morden. The menu is varied with six types of bread and a variety of drinks. I'm deeply in love with coconut so I tried eating JJ and drinking a cup of coconut coffee. Oh, everthing is so wonderful.The staff of the bakery is also enthusiastic and likable. In my opinion,this is a place you should vistit when traveling Da Nang, especially when it rains!\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
